   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The response to conscription in the North revealed that",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1170977,
     "content_html": "nativism still had a significant influence in the Union"
    },
    {
     "id": 1170976,
     "content_html": "the United States was becoming a “melting pot”"
    },
    {
     "id": 1170975,
     "content_html": "persons of all backgrounds were willing to fight in the Civil War"
    },
    {
     "id": 1170974,
     "content_html": "the idea of national unity was significant in maintaining a strong democracy"
    }
